WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
The Army built Camp Century inside Greenland’s ice in 1959.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Project Iceworm proposed a much larger missile network.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
The ice moved and deformed; the missile network was never built.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
NASA’s 2024 image shows a known Cold War site, not an ancient city.
